        reversedList.add(list.get(i));
    }
    return reversedList;
}
```
This algorithm uses a for loop to iterate through the list of integers and adds each element to the reversed list. The size of the list is used to determine the end index of the reversed list, and the get() method is used to retrieve the element at the current index.

