* `query`: The query string component of the URL, which is everything after the first `#` character and before the next `?`.
* `hash`: The hash component of the URL, which is everything after the second `#` character.
* `fragment`: The fragment component of the URL, which is everything after the second `#` character and before the end of the URL.

